			"• Secret lock driver body x 1",
			"• Hand wheel",
			"• Driver bit x 4 types",
			"• Secret screw box body x 1",
			"• 4 types of screws x 2 each",
			"• Seal×1",
			"• Runner×1 (badge)",
			"• Handling manual×1",
			"• Pikachin sheet x 1",
			"[battery]",
			"• Not required"
		]
